    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.3",
      "title": "Eye Slots",
      "body": "Eye slots should resemble sources for the visor.\nEye slots should not exceed 25mm tall to prevent any injury.\nKlappvisor with 2 Eye slots are allowed to add up to two (2) safety Eye bars per Eye slot.\n\nKlappvisor may have integrated Eye bars. Such Eye bars must be made accordingly with historical sources, in terms of proportion, numbers and aesthetic.\n\nExternally riveted Eye bars are not allowed.\nEye bars must conform to the “Eye bars” document.",
      "page_from": 8,
      "page_to": 8,
