    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.4",
      "title": "Aventail",
      "body": "Klappvisors must be worn with chainmail Aventails, fabric Aventails, or scales Aventails.\nAventails must conform to the “Aventails” document.\nAventails must be attached to the bascinet by a system of leather and vervelles.\n\nChainmail Aventail must be fastened down to the edge of a padded pelerine, attached to the helmet liner.\n\nScales and Fabric Aventails are recommended to be fastened down to the edge of a padded pelerine, attached to the helmet liner.\n\nAny additional protective plates covering the cervical spine must be hidden under the Aventail.",
