      "title": "Changelog",
      "body": "Below, we will keep track of all the changes made over the lifetime of this document. This way, all our members can see how the documents are changing over time.\n\nJanuary - 2026 (V. 26.1) Formatting redone for consistency and readability. Except points listed below, no content changes.\n\nAdd: “1. Implementation” (and subsequent modification of all Title numbers in the document)\n- In 4.4 Aventails: “The aventail” by “Chainmail aventail”\n\nAdd:\n\n- In 4.3 Eye slots: “Externally riveted eye bars are not allowed.“\n\nReplace:\n\n- In 4.4 Aventails: “The aventail” by “Chainmail aventail”\n\nAdd:\n\n- In 4.4 Aventails: “Scales and Fabric aventails are recommended to be fastened down to the edge of a padded pelerine, attached to the helmet liner.”\n\nSuppression:\n\nIn 5. Denied reproductions: “+”\n\nMarch-2025:\nFormatting: Grammar and Formatting\n\nAdd: 3.3 Klappvisor may have integrated Eye bars. Such eye bars must be made accordingly with historical sources, in terms of proportion, numbers and aesthetic.\n\n11-Nov-2024: -Add Document has been created",
